WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.360
What would happen if a chessboard,&nbsp;
complete with arranged pieces,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.880
was run through the Clockworks?&nbsp;
Professor Q hoped to find out.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.040
When placed into the machine on 1:1,&nbsp;
the white king’s pawn moved up 2 spaces.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.760
The above board, with a black&nbsp;
pawn moved to a legal position,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.240
was placed into the machine on 1:1, the&nbsp;
white queen was moved to a legal position.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.680
Professor Q noted, “Yes, I've&nbsp;
been playing chess with 914.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.960
Yes, I'm aware it's probably non-sentient,&nbsp;
but that hardly explains why it's winning.”

